WEBVTT

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:07.238
<b>I</b>’m Peruvian. <b>My</b> family is from Cusco.

00:00:08.389 --> 00:00:11.970
<b>You</b>’re in Class 1. This is <b>your</b> classroom.

00:00:12.828 --> 00:00:15.925
<b>He</b>’s the director. <b>His</b> name is Michael.

00:00:16.475 --> 00:00:19.672
<b>She</b>’s your teacher. <b>Her</b> name is Tina.

00:00:20.381 --> 00:00:24.215
<b>It</b>’s a language school. <b>Its</b> name is English House.

00:00:24.882 --> 00:00:30.718
<b>We</b>’re an international school. <b>Our</b> students are from South America and Asia.

00:00:31.732 --> 00:00:35.539
<b>They</b>’re French students. <b>Their</b> names are Luc and Marie.